+- [ ] T021 Implement `sanitize_for_message(text)` in `src/accounts/cli.py`: render every character outside printable ASCII as `\xNN` and truncate at 64 characters, applied to any username echoed into a message (SR-002, SR-009, research R9). The store path is exempt and echoed verbatim — SR-009 exempts the operator's own argument
