+## Phase 3: User Story 1 - Register an account and prove a password (Priority: P1) 🎯 MVP
+
+**Goal**: An operator creates a named account with a password and later checks a
+supplied password against it, getting an exit status a script can branch on. The
+account survives between invocations in the store file.
+
+**Independent Test**: Register an account into a fresh store path, then run a
+check with the right password and with a wrong password in two further
+invocations, and confirm the printed output and exit status of each
+(quickstart V1, V2). Nothing from the other stories is needed.
+
+**Scope note**: `login` here verifies only. The failure **count** (FR-015) and
+the lock (FR-016, FR-017) belong to User Story 2, so in this phase `login`
+never writes the store.
+
