+## Phase 5: User Story 3 - Change a password (Priority: P3)
+
+**Goal**: The holder of an account replaces its password by proving the current
+one in the same invocation, which also clears any lock.
+
+**Independent Test**: Register an account, change its password supplying the
+current one, then confirm the new password verifies and the old one does not.
+
